   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FIGHT ALCOHOLISM IN KARAMOJA PROJ2022-2023 FIGHT ALCOHOLISM</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project &#x201C;Fighting the plague of alcoholism in Karamoja&#x201D; is aimed at reducing/curbing consumption of alcohol in Karamoja sub-region since it has become an epidemic, a serious health threat as well as a social problem. This project receive funds for 2 consecutive years (phase I and II), the project is now moving to phase III to consolidate achievements while deepening awareness at grass root level in the same 3 project components.</narrative>
  </description>
